00:01:51.320 --> 00:01:52.300
who is an Attorney

00:01:52.300 --> 00:01:54.510
and the author of "#Driven"

00:01:54.510 --> 00:01:56.550
also the founder of Corey Empowers

00:01:56.550 --> 00:01:58.550
