00:02:15.570 --> 00:02:16.850
so I'm grateful we were able

00:02:16.850 --> 00:02:18.470
to make this pairing work.

00:02:18.470 --> 00:02:20.430
And people also know
Corey as a thought leader

00:02:20.430 --> 00:02:21.720
