00:02:21.720 --> 00:02:26.420
with a primary focus on
mental wellness advocacy.

00:02:26.420 --> 00:02:27.580
As I mentioned in 2019,

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:31.023
she released her and now
highly celebrated debut book,

00:02:31.023 --> 00:02:32.300
"#Driven" with a foreward

00:02:32.300 --> 00:02:35.070
