00:31:29.850 --> 00:31:30.683
It's unfortunate,

00:31:30.683 --> 00:31:34.060
for us it took the murder of George Floyd

00:31:34.060 --> 00:31:35.223
for that to happen.

00:31:36.460 --> 00:31:37.640
But since last summer,

00:31:37.640 --> 00:31:39.210
it's really been a consistent,

00:31:39.210 --> 00:31:41.320
ongoing source of support

00:31:41.320 --> 00:31:45.100
where the people who attend
that group feel seen.

00:31:45.100 --> 00:31:46.464
they are experiencing it.

00:31:46.464 --> 00:31:48.580
When you talk about what
you're going through

00:31:48.580 --> 00:31:49.553
and people are nodding along

00:31:49.553 --> 00:31:51.970
because they get it, you feel,

00:31:51.970 --> 00:31:52.803
you feel that,

00:31:52.803 --> 00:31:56.120
you feel validated and
seen and normalized.

00:31:56.120 --> 00:31:58.260
And it's similar to what Corey said about

