00:32:08.550 --> 00:32:11.110
but it's different when it's your parent

00:32:11.110 --> 00:32:12.750
than it is if it's your spouse

00:32:12.750 --> 00:32:14.180
or your adult child.

00:32:14.180 --> 00:32:16.240
Those relationships matter,

00:32:16.240 --> 00:32:17.430
it's the same thing

00:32:17.430 --> 00:32:20.430
that all of those sort of data points,

00:32:20.430 --> 00:32:21.450
we really wanna make sure

00:32:21.450 --> 00:32:24.570
that there's connectivity among them

00:32:24.570 --> 00:32:26.550
so that people are getting the most

00:32:26.550 --> 00:32:29.220
