00:55:38.730 --> 00:55:41.910
I put together my go-to
mental health guide.

00:55:41.910 --> 00:55:44.010
And again, me just coming in raw with this

00:55:44.010 --> 00:55:46.237
and just wanting to learn all I can,

00:55:46.237 --> 00:55:50.240
but it has movies and books, blogs, apps,

00:55:50.240 --> 00:55:51.297
just different things that you can go to

00:55:51.297 --> 00:55:54.140
at your leisure to find out more.

00:55:54.140 --> 00:55:55.460
If it's someone you're dating,

00:55:55.460 --> 00:55:56.293
someone you're married to,

00:55:56.293 --> 00:55:58.320
or a family member or your child,

00:55:58.320 --> 00:56:00.770
